st subspecies particular to certain regions. Their sturdy upper limbs accelerate their excavation of rock exponentially, while their stern shells can shrug off severe batterings. These traits allow them to better expand their territory.","abilities":["Weak spot located on its front, damage dealt to the rear is significantly decreased"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":680,"def":130,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"raging_direswine":{"slug":"raging_direswine","name":"Raging Direswine","icon":"/enemies-icons/Raging Direswine.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A variety of Direswine extremely easy to anger, they dominate areas near water sources with great swagger. If one is enraged, it will indiscriminately rampage about with a madness sufficient to lay anything in the vicinity low.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by units with at least 2 Block","Gradually accelerates when charging, dealing damage based on Movement Speed to any target it passes through or is blocked by"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":32000,"atk":700,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"rathalos":{"slug":"rathalos","name":"Rathalos","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rathalos.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"The crimson-carapaced, flame-commanding Rathalos, its capacity for flight excels among Flying Wyverns, its aerial assaults and flaming breath combine to dominate over a vast array of life. Owing to the astonishing strength by which it rules the air, it is also known as the 'King of the Skies.'","abilities":["Can only be blocked by Operators with 3 or more Block","Grounded State","The Rath